@GreenhouseGuard_HostAddress = http://localhost:5271
@ContentType = application/json

### Get Latest Sensor Reading
GET {{GreenhouseGuard_HostAddress}}/api/readings/latest
Accept: {{ContentType}}

###

### Get Recent Anomalies
GET {{GreenhouseGuard_HostAddress}}/api/anomalies
Accept: {{ContentType}}

###

