### Create Sensor Reading
POST {{GreenhouseGuard_HostAddress}}/api/readings
Content-Type: {{ContentType}}
[
  {
    "temperature": 30,
    "humidity": 100,
    "co2Ppm": 100,
    "timestamp": "2026-09-30T11:50:00Z"
  }
]

